<title>UK: Chiroscience /Schering-Plough in asthma agreement.</title>
<headline>Chiroscience /Schering-Plough in asthma agreement.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Chirsoscience Group Plc said on Friday that it has agreed with Schering-Plough Corp to develop oral treatments for asthma and other inflammatory diseases.</p>
</text>
